summary.label:
Enerjsmart is a WiFi devices control and mange application system by app. You can control the wifi devices at home or office through internet by app.

The software features:
1/ Remotely control home appliances from anywhere;
2/ Simultaneously control multiple devices with one app;
3/ Set timer to easily perform multiple functions;

Control with your voice works with Alexa for voice control
No hub required the smart plug works with any Wi-Fi router without the need for a separate hub
Schedule automatically turn on/off your devices based on specific time you set, never come back to a dark house
Remote control instantly turn on/off your light or other appliance with your smart phone or tablet wherever you are
Wide application: Can be used for fans, air-condition, cell phone chargers, lights, coffee mill etc.
